\p 
\v 1 [Then we turned]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and took our journey]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w* \w by the way| strong="H1870" \w* \w of the Red| strong="H5488" \w* \w sea| strong="H3220" \w*, as the \sc Lord\sc* [spake]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [unto me: and we compassed]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Seir| strong="H8165" \w* \w many| strong="H7227" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w*. 
