\v 11 \w Then there shall be a place| strong="H4725" \w* which the \sc Lord\sc* \w your God| strong="H430" \w* [shall choose]{strong=“H977” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to cause his name| strong="H8034" \w* [to dwell]{strong=“H7931” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} [there; thither shall ye bring]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [all that I command]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} [you; your burnt offerings]{strong=“H5930”}, \w and your sacrifices| strong="H2077" \w*, \w your tithes| strong="H4643" \w*, \w and the heave offering| strong="H8641" \w* \w of your hand| strong="H3027" \w*, \w and all your choice| strong="H4005" \w* \w vows| strong="H5088" \w* [which ye vow]{strong=“H5087” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*:\f + \fr 12:11 \ft your choice…: Heb. the choice of your vows \f* 
