\v 6 \w At the mouth| strong="H6310" \w* \w of two| strong="H8147" \w* \w witnesses| strong="H5707" \w*, \w or three| strong="H7969" \w* \w witnesses| strong="H5707" \w*, [shall he that is worthy of death]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8714”} [be put to death]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”}; but \w at the mouth| strong="H6310" \w* \w of one| strong="H259" \w* \w witness| strong="H5707" \w* [he shall not be put to death]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8714”}. 
