\v 4 \w Because| strong="H1697" \w* [they met]{strong=“H6923” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w you not with bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w and with water| strong="H4325" \w* \w in the way| strong="H1870" \w*, [when ye came forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w out of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*; [and because they hired]{strong=“H7936” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w against thee Balaam| strong="H1109" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Beor| strong="H1160" \w* \w of Pethor| strong="H6604" \w* \w of Mesopotamia| strong="H763" \w*, [to curse]{strong=“H7043” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} thee. 
\v 5 Nevertheless the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* [would]{strong=“H14” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not hearken]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w unto Balaam| strong="H1109" \w*; but the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* [turned ]{strong=“H2015” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the curse| strong="H7045" \w* \w into a blessing| strong="H1293" \w* unto thee, because the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* [loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} thee. 
