\c 26
\p 
\v 1 And it shall be, when thou art [come in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the land| strong="H776" \w* which the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* [giveth ]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} thee for \w an inheritance| strong="H5159" \w*, [and possessest]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [it, and dwellest]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} therein; 
