\v 16 ([For ye know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [how we have dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*; [and how we came]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w through| strong="H7130" \w* \w the nations| strong="H1471" \w* [which ye passed by]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; 
