\p 
\v 1 [And it shall come to pass, when all these things]{strong=“H1697”} [are come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [upon thee, the blessing]{strong=“H1293”} \w and the curse| strong="H7045" \w*, [which I have set]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [thee, and thou shalt call]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} them \w to mind| strong="H3824" \w* \w among all the nations| strong="H1471" \w*, whither the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* [hath driven]{strong=“H5080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} thee, 
