\v 5 And the \sc Lord\sc* [shall give them up]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w before your face| strong="H6440" \w*, [that ye may do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto them according unto all the commandments| strong="H4687" \w* [which I have commanded]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} you. 
