\v 4 And the \sc Lord\sc* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto him, This is \w the land| strong="H776" \w* [which I sware]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w unto Abraham| strong="H85" \w*, \w unto Isaac| strong="H3327" \w*, \w and unto Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [I will give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w it unto thy seed| strong="H2233" \w*: [I have caused thee to see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} it \w with thine eyes| strong="H5869" \w*, [but thou shalt not go over]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} thither. 
\p
\v 5 \w So Moses| strong="H4872" \w* \w the servant| strong="H5650" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [died]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w there in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Moab| strong="H4124" \w*, \w according to the word| strong="H6310" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*. 
